      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARROW TIME (7) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (22.81) at this track. Has ability and looks hard to stop. JUST BELIEVE (2) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Doongalla Rocket (22.91) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Must be included in calculations. COLLINDA EXPRESS (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 2.75 lengths (22.59) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5 over 390m. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and two minor placings from 11 starts. Leading player again. LOUD MOUTH LOUIE (3) cannot be ruled out.",
